    "fabricationNotes": [
      "External regulated, current-limited 5 V input connects at J1 pin 1 (VCC) and pin 2 (GND).",
      "SW1 is a momentary normally-open Omron B3F-1000. Its four physical terminals are mapped using the manufacturer bottom-view numbering; confirm the orientation before assembly.",
      "When pressed, SW1 drives SW_OUT. R1 limits LED current; R2 pulls SW_OUT to ground while the button is open. The ideal model excludes switch bounce, contact aging and supply transients.",
      "48 mm x 34 mm single-sided educational PCB. DRC and exports do not replace independent manufacturing review."
    ]
  },
