    "physicalNotes": [
      "Use a regulated, current-limited 5 V source. J1 positive feeds the button; J1 return connects to the blue ground rail.",
      "SW1 is shown as a source-backed off-board momentary switch with insulated leads from one terminal on each contact side: contact side 2/4 to TP6 (VCC) and side 1/3 to B10 (SW_OUT). The redundant contact legs are not used on the BB400.",
